cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use loupe in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: loupe
abstract: Finds text on web pages that people can't see but AI agents read, and whether it reaches the markdown agents are given. It runs locally, in a browser or from the markup alone, with Bright Data as an option for sites that block bots.
authors:
